=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook%20of%20Mind%20Control\"><img alt=\"Spellbook of Mind Control\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_of_Mind_Control_15eca0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lightning Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lightning_Robe_723488.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Robe\"><img alt=\"Blue Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Robe_36c1c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demona Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"71\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demona_Map_071e25.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Demona is hidden below the <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">Maze of Lost Souls</a> to protect the city from bandits and warriors. This city is the home to many <a href=\"#/wiki/Warlock\">Warlocks</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanists</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a> and two <a href=\"#/wiki/Infernalist\">Infernalist</a>. There are several quest-items located here.\n</p><p><b>Requirements:</b><br/>\n<b>Knights: 80+</b><br/>\n100 Explosion or Stone Shower runes 600 <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potions</a> and a minimum of 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potions</a>\n</p><p><b>Mages: 60+ (shooting)</b><br/>\n100 Explosion or Stone Shower runes, 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">Sudden Death</a> runes and a minimum of 200 <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potions</a>\n</p><p><b>Mages: 100+ (soloing)</b><br/>\n100 Explosion or Stone Shower runes and a minimum of 300 <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potions</a>\n</p><p><b>Paladins: 100+</b><br/>\n100 Explosion or Stone Shower runes, 500 <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Stars</a> and 300 <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potions</a>.\n</p><p><b>Killing Warlocks as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a>:</b><br/>\nThe following strategy can be applied by <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> when hunting any creature that uses Magic Damage as its primary means of damage-dealing, but is especially useful against the Warlocks in the \"lobby\" of Demona, i.e. the area that leads to the three other rooms and contains a pentagrammatical formation of walls. Bring a <a href=\"#/wiki/Closed%20Trap\">Closed Trap</a> with you and make your way to either the north-western or the north-eastern vertex of the pentagram without fighting any <a href=\"#/wiki/Warlock\">Warlocks</a> just yet. Place the trap inside the one-way passage and lure a Warlock to your vertex of choice. Now quickly position yourself inside the vertex and diagonally adjacent to your trap, which you should open at this point. The Warlock will not know what to do – he can only reach you with his attacks from the square the trap is on, but that position also leaves him vulnerable to your strikes. He will therefore keep ambling back and forth between the trap square and the one before it without attacking you with any of his magical attacks. Attack the Warlock (but make sure <i>Chase opponent</i> is off!) and keep opening the trap over and over in order to prevent him from going invisible. When he is about to run due to massive blood loss, lure him into the vertex and trap him. He can attack you properly now (obviously), but the few remaining hit points he has left are easily eliminated with the help of some physical spells. Rinse and repeat this strategy with the other Warlocks in the room, and your days of burning your feet while frantically chasing after invisible Warlocks like a headless chicken are finally over.\n</p><p>If you forgot or lost the Closed Trap, aim and use Lesser Front Sweep or use a Stone Shower or an Explosion rune when the Warlock goes invisible.\n</p><p>Elite Knights have an easier time soloing Warlocks due to their greater array of Spells, elite knights 150+ can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a> to force Warlocks to come close (the spell is successful only when these monsters are visible, but works after their disappearance too). From now on, just cast Blood Rage and finish them off quickly with autoattack and <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> spells. If they remain alive for too long, just recast Chivalrous Challenge and repeat. In case they disappear, throw some area runes or Groundshake spell on them. \n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demona warlocks small\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"209\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demona_warlocks_small_0d8f38.png\" width=\"286\"/></span>\n</p><p><b>Path:</b><br/>\nIn order to get there, you'll have to go through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">MoLS</a>. Refer to Route:Demona.\n</p><p>There are three quests located here, namely the <a href=\"#/quest/purple-tome-quest\">Purple Tome Quest</a>, the <a href=\"#/quest/crystal-wand-quest\">Crystal Wand Quest</a>, and the <a href=\"#/quest/demona-ring-quest\">Demona Ring Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Demona Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Guard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Guard_7dc402.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guard</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">185</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-20× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Horn\">Minotaur Horn</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Piece of Warrior Armor (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chain%20Armor\">Chain Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fishing%20Rod\">Fishing Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Leather\">Minotaur Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Trophy\">Minotaur Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Stone Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Golem_9e60ec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">270</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">110 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-40× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Power Ring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Sword\">Carlin Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Ancient Stone (rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Marble%20Rock\">Piece of Marble Rock</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ring\">Crystal Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\"><img alt=\"Dwarf Guard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_Guard_eca737.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">165</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">245</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">140 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Boots\">Leather Boots</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scale%20Armor\">Scale Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Battle%20Hammer\">Battle Hammer</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe%20Ring\">Axe Ring</a> (very rare)</l